{"unit_id":"tag:095U:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的固有态射（proper morphism），其所有纤维（fibres）的维数（dimension）均为<MATH_0002>。那么，对于任意阿贝尔（abelian）挠（torsion）层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>（位于<MATH_0004>上），有<MATH_0005>，对<MATH_0006>成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射的对象"},{"source_term":"proper morphism","target_term":"固有态射","context":"引理假设"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"维数条件"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"纤维的界"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"系数性质"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","context":"系数性质"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数层"}],"notes":[]}
